<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the second day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>In Port-of-Spain: Leeward Islands 208 and 95 (D.Ramarine 4-28). Trinidad and Tobago 110 (W.Quinn 4-39) and 9-2.</p>
<p>In St George's, Grenada: Windward Islands 446 (J.Murray 218, B.Watt 50; M.Nagamootoo 4-104). Guyana 170-3 (R.Sarwan 54, Z.Haniff 51 not out).</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Barbados 258 (F.Reifer 59) and 21-0. Jamaica 282 (W.Hinds 84, D.Morgan 54; O.Gibson 4-55).</p>
</text>
